  "src": "same-color top and bottom edge bars on a black background, separated by one full-width red row",
  "transform": "compute the overlap of the two bar column sets; on the side whose edge bar is longer, paint yellow in those overlap columns between the edge row and the red separator; leave all other pixels unchanged"
}
</annotation>
<generation_spec>
